REPOSITORY
----------

  Name:        agent.elixpo (elixpoo)
What it is:  Elixpo's policy-bound GitHub project-management agent (@elixpoo).
               Python squads run as GitHub Actions that pick up community
               issues, fork, solve, open PRs, and shepherd them to merge. No
               server, no database - state lives in GitHub issues, a Project
               board, and state/*.json.

